{"id":"n93441-1-5","stage":4,"title":"상갓집 · 丧家","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93441-1-5-1","ko":"무슨 일이야? 분위기가 상갓집 같아.","zh":"发生什么事了？气氛怎么像丧家一样啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일이야?","meaning":"是什么事？","explanation":"일（事情）＋이다（是）＋-야；与前面的 무슨 合用，询问发生了什么事。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이야","audio":"/audio/07685cceee2c1aebca4e.mp3"}},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"1","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분위기가","audio":"/audio/aeafae1134479b98bf89.mp3"}},{"text":"상갓집","meaning":"丧家，举丧之家","explanation":"상갓집：丧家，举丧之家","readings":[{"term":"상갓집","audio":"/audio/87741f5bb455b71b0b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93441","senseId":"1","lemma":"상갓집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상갓집","audio":"/audio/87741f5bb455b71b0b27.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc7